      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "When using a rate schedule, if you provide a start date that occurs in the past, the current date and time are used as the start date.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] (string)",
      "protected": [
